        "created_at": "2025-07-06T09:42:25.915456+00:00",
        "notes": "[Iaido Strike](item_0b4def91-53c9-4bb7-b706-05aff6e4b168) adds a huge burst damage tool to Genji's kit that starts strong and scales very easily. Taking advantage of the fact that Blade scales off both WP and AP, we can stack [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) to maximize its power within the first round. Depending on how confident you are and how the hero matchups look, you can opt for the riskier [Frenzy Amplifier](item_d4b0cfcb-14e9-4472-a688-680120217250) or play it a bit safer with  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf). \n\n---\n\nAs with most other heroes, Genji largely plays the same as normal Overwatch in the first round, but the massively boosted offensive potential of deflect now makes securing kills far easier. I use the Iaido swing as a good closer to clean up consistent backline picks on supports.",
