        "notes": "Since we'll be building AP anyway, [Laceration](item_ee831ad3-3921-4aca-a761-c6b93cc7e7fe) is just free damage waiting to be picked up. [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) has great synergy with this power, offering boosted ult charge from swift strike and Iaido, but if you don't prefer playing for ult then [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) or  [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) can offer solid buffs to the playstyle you should be used to from previous rounds. Pad out the rest of your slots with whatever common items your econ will permit, making sure to prioritize [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418).\n\n---\n\nI like to optimize for ult charge and use it to help burn tanks quickly, taking advantage of the fact that blade should be a serious threat by this point. However, if you don't like playing with dragonblade, superflexor is a good way to buff Iaido even further. Gloomgauntlet is a strong 15% damage buff, but it only applies to dragonblade and quick melee so you won't be seeing any interplay from having picked up laceration this round.",
