        "created_at": "2025-07-06T09:42:25.915456+00:00",
        "notes": "You should have [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) and  [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) by now. You could stretch for [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) if econ permits, but Superflexor is just cheaper and offers a nice 10% WP. If you absolutely despise the idea of building for ult, you could substitute Catalytic Crystal for [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) and [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e).\n\n---\n\nHaving superflexor in your kit will slightly change your tempo; while it was already good practice to do so, now you're really going to want to make sure you land at least a full alt fire before investing the rest of your cooldowns. Note that Dragonblade (and Iaido) both count as WP attacks, so just popping ult and hitting swings will keep your superflexor active.",
