        "created_at": "2025-07-06T09:42:25.915456+00:00",
        "notes": "[Wyrm\u2019s Maw](item_5d8c3488-13a9-432a-987e-275522f68cc4) is essentially just an extension of [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) from the previous round, further buffing swift strike and making assassinations that much easier.  [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) gains two stacks from Iaido since deflect and blade are counted as two abilities, so it's actually a sneaky 20% WP buff, 25% if you use swift strike beforehand.\n\n---\n\nYour build should be pretty much complete by round 5, with only the finishing touches coming in 6 and 7. This setup hits the perfect sweetspot of about 50% WP and AP; Iaido seems to scale slower past these numbers.",
