        "notes": "There's a lot of flexibility with how you approach the final round. [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) and [Hashimoto\u2019s Bane](item_03650ff3-917e-45fe-aeed-11c0f24c0eba) can open up another avenue for cleaning up close range kills besides Iaido, [Hidden Blade](item_a820416d-85e5-4018-b20a-dc1cbf744900) or [Hanamura Healing](item_d210417d-1e30-4571-a4f3-cccd1dfc23ca) can offer great survivability depending on which cooldown you're relying on more at this point, even [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) could offer an interesting mid round power spike by just holding ult.\n\n---\n\nBy this point the enemy is sure to expect your massive Iaido slugs so the more flighty characters like juno and mercy are quite challenging to lock down. Hashimoto's bane and Eye of the Spider is my preferred option, but depending on the enemy's comp and build you could go for a tankier setup.",
